OL,3,GNEWSAPolice praised despite child
OL,4,Asafeguarding concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force has been praised for
OL,7,Fimproving criminal investigations, but
OL,8,Finspectors noted failures in child
OL,9,Fsafeguarding, fraud and stop-and-search
OL,10,Fpractices.
OL,12,FWest Midlands Police (WMP) was
OL,13,Fcommended for improved leadership,
OL,14,Fresponse to the public and handling
OL,15,Finvestigations by the watchdog, but its
OL,16,Fuse of handcuffs and response to
OL,17,Fchildren living with domestic abuse
OL,18,Fwere criticised.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
