OL,3,GNEWSAPolice praised despite child
OL,4,Asafeguarding concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FHM Chief Inspector of Constabulary
OL,7,FKathryn Stone said overall she was
OL,8,Fsatisfied with its performance in
OL,9,Fkeeping people safe and reducing crime.
OL,11,FThe force said the report recognised
OL,12,Fthe effort of officers, staff and
OL,13,Fvolunteers "in achieving such rapid and
OL,14,Funparalleled improvements in policing".
